#: 18e3baf11a444537b2c4d63f322505e8
msgid ""
"PyBroker reimplements standard indicators with volatility normalization "
"and a robust non-linear rescaling so their values are comparable across "
"symbols and market regimes."
msgstr "PyBroker 对标准指标进行了重新实现，加入了波动率归一化和稳健的非线性重缩放，使其值在不同股票代码和不同市场状态下都具有可比性。"

